    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**TXT Rachel on arrival for access 0879496889**\r\n\r\nLynam Auctioneers are delighted to introduce this luxury 2 bedroom apartment to the market. Extending to approximately 74m2, No. 9 The Croft is filled with natural light and boasts a B BER rating and a uniquely spacious private balcony.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented throughout, accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with timber flooring leading to 2 spacious and well appointed bedrooms. Both bedrooms are light filled and feature built-in wardrobes. The master bedroom has an elegantly furnished en suite bathroom. No 9 also has an additional bathroom with a bath, ideal for a growing family.  Off the hall is a most useful, large utility room. \r\n\r\nThe living room  is bright and spacious with light spilling in from the large south east facing balcony. The kitchen boasts sleek cabinetry and modern appliances and finishes. \r\n\r\nAccommodation in No. 9  is completed by a large private  balcony/sunroom offering an additional outdoor space for entertaining or relaxing. The balcony has a south east orientation and views over the mature and well kept communal gardens of The Croft. \r\n\r\nNo. 9 The Croft is located in a highly sought after development. This property enjoys both a quiet and highly convenient location close to a wide variety of amenities and public transport options. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing advised"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "87 sqm INCLUDING the balcony\r\n\r\nEntrance hall: c. 3.01m x 2.00m\r\nTimber flooring. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nHot press: c. 1.50m x 1.51m\r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 1.79m x 2.43m\r\nWC. WHB. Bath\r\n\r\nUtility room: c. 1.79m x 1.85m\r\nSpacious and shelved.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c. 4.36m max x 3.40m\r\nWell appointed light filled double bedroom. Built in wardrobes. Carpeted.\r\n\r\nEn suite: c. 2.18m x 1.51m\r\nWC. WHB. Shower cubicle\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 4.36m x 2.73m\r\nDouble bedroom. Built in wardrobes. Carpeted.\r\n\r\nLiving room/dining : c. 5.58m x 3.70m\r\nTimber flooring. \r\n\r\nKitchen: c. 1.73m x 2.67m\r\n\r\nBalcony: c. 6.07m x 2.00m\r\nSouth east facing and enclosed. Overlooking The Croft communal gardens\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of the floor plan contained here, measurements of doors, windows, rooms and any other item are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission, or misstatement. This plan is for illustrative purposes only and should only be used as such by any prospective purchaser."
      },
